    "AttentionItem": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "A fired Watch or a due Commitment the Brain raised, delivered by attention recall (Memory Interface §4). Every item is raised by a commit — a watch_fire Activity or a commitment_review Activity keyed commitment_review:<commitment id>:<due_at> — and raised_seq is that commit's space_seq. Attention grants nothing.",
